@startuml
title User Registration and Authentication Sequence

actor User
participant "Angular SPA" as SPA
participant "AuthController (API)" as API
participant "UserService" as US
database "Database (User Repository)" as DB

User -> SPA : Attempts registration (email, password, name)
SPA -> API : POST /api/auth/register(data)
activate API
API -> US : registerUser(details)
activate US

US -> DB : validateEmailAndUsername(email, username)
activate DB
DB --> US : Email/Username availability confirmed
deactivate DB

US -> US : Hash Password
US -> DB : saveUser(user, hashedPassword)
activate DB
DB --> US : User created successfully (User ID)
deactivate DB

US --> API : User registered (success status, userId)
deactivate US
API --> SPA : 201 Created (Registration Confirmation)
deactivate API

User -> SPA : Receives confirmation/credentials
SPA -> User : Display success message
@enduml